2 Installing
************

These steps are for Debian 12 or 13, or Ubuntu 24.04.

  1. Put the three '.deb' files in one folder, open a terminal there,
     and install them:

          sudo apt install ./colloquy_0.3.0_all.deb \
            ./news-analysis-cases_0.3.0_all.deb \
            ./news-analysis-system_0.3.0_all.deb

     It worked if the output includes 'Setting up news-analysis-system'.
     apt also installs SWI-Prolog if you do not have it.

  2. Check the engine and the cases:

          colloquy version
          colloquy cases

     Expect 'colloquy 0.3.0', then three case names.

Once installed, this tutorial is in the Info directory: run 'info
news-analysis', or in Emacs press 'C-h i' and choose 'News Analysis'.
The proposal paper is installed as
'/usr/share/doc/news-analysis-system/news-analysis-system.pdf'.


